# 💻 Practice 8 — Complete Professional Decorator Pattern

```python
from functools import wraps


def decorator(function):

    @wraps(function)
    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):

        result = function(*args, **kwargs)

        return result

    return wrapper


@decorator
def greet(name):
    return "Hello " + name


result = greet("Manoj")

print(result)
print(greet.__name__)
```

### Output

```text
Hello Manoj
greet
```

