# 🧠 Final Professional Decorator Pattern

```python
from functools import wraps


def decorator(function):

    @wraps(function)
    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):

        # Before logic

        result = function(*args, **kwargs)

        # After logic

        return result

    return wrapper
```

## 🎯 Decorator Flow

```text
Function
   ↓
Decorator
   ↓
Wrapper
   ↓
Before Logic
   ↓
Original Function
   ↓
Store Result
   ↓
After Logic
   ↓
Return Result
   ↓
@wraps Preserves Original Information
```
